        "settings": {
          "question": "Will it work for multiple cats?",
          "answer": "<p>Absolutely — it's built for it. The 90L globe and large sealed drawer comfortably handle up to four cats, and the app tracks each cat individually by weight.</p>"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "qa",
        "settings": {
          "question": "What litter does it use?",
          "answer": "<p>Any quality clumping clip litter (clay or tofu/plant-based clumping). No proprietary refills, no subscriptions.</p>"
